# General
key.betterfoliage.gui=Open Settings

betterfoliage.general=General Mod Configs
betterfoliage.general.tooltip=Configs that affect all aspects of the mod.
betterfoliage.general.enabled=Enable mod
betterfoliage.general.enabled.tooltip=If set to false, all changes made by Better Foliage - Legacy Edition will be disabled.
betterfoliage.general.seed=Seed
betterfoliage.general.seed.tooltip=Primary mod seed used as the base for pseudo-random placement of features.\nAllows features to be consistent across different players.\nChange it to a secret number to make it harder for someone to brute force your coordinates from a screenshot, if you care about that.\nFor this reason, this config is deliberately not shown in-game.

# Generics
betterfoliage.enabled=Enabled
betterfoliage.enabled.tooltip=Is this feature enabled?
betterfoliage.hOffset=Horizontal Offset
betterfoliage.hOffset.tooltip=The distance this element is shifted horizontally, in blocks.
betterfoliage.vOffset=Vertical Offset
betterfoliage.vOffset.tooltip=The distance this element is shifted vertically, in blocks.
betterfoliage.size=Size
betterfoliage.size.tooltip=Size of this element.
betterfoliage.heightMin=Minimum Height
betterfoliage.heightMin.tooltip=Minimum height of element.
betterfoliage.heightMax=Maximum Height
betterfoliage.heightMax.tooltip=Maximum height of element.
betterfoliage.threshold=Threshold
betterfoliage.threshold.tooltip=Chance that an eligible block will have this feature.\nUsed as a cutoff value in a 3D noise generator.
betterfoliage.maxLifetime=Maximum Particle Lifetime
betterfoliage.maxLifetime.tooltip=Maximum lifetime of particle, in seconds. Minimum lifetime is 60 percent of this value.
betterfoliage.shaderWind=Shader wind effects
betterfoliage.shaderWind.tooltip=Apply wind effects from ShaderMod shaders to this element?
betterfoliage.biomes=Biome Filters
betterfoliage.biomes.tooltip=A list of biomes filters that determine if this feature is allowed to appear in a specific biome.\nCheck the wiki for more details on how biome filters work.

# Block Filters
betterfoliage.blocks=Block Filter Lists
betterfoliage.blocks.tooltip=Configure the lists of block filters that determine which blocks are considered valid for each of the mod's features.\nCheck the wiki for more details on how block filters work.
betterfoliage.blocks.dirt=Filters: Dirt
betterfoliage.blocks.dirt.tooltip=A list of block filters that determine which blocks are recognized as Dirt.\nHas an impact on Reeds, Algae, Connected Grass.
betterfoliage.blocks.grass=Filters: Grass
betterfoliage.blocks.grass.tooltip=A list of block filters that determine which blocks are recognized as Grass.\nHas an impact on Short Grass, Connected Grass.
betterfoliage.blocks.obstructShortGrass=Filters: Obstructs Short Grass
betterfoliage.blocks.obstructShortGrass.tooltip=A list of block filters that determine which blocks will prevent Short Grass from rendering if placed on top of a Grass block.\nNote that a non-transparent full block will ALWAYS block rendering, even if it's not listed. 
betterfoliage.blocks.extraLeaves=Filters: Extra Leaves
betterfoliage.blocks.extraLeaves.tooltip=A list of Block filters that determine which blocks can render Extra Leaves.\nThis is separate from the blocks that can render Falling Leaf particles.
betterfoliage.blocks.fallingLeaves=Filters: Falling Leaves
betterfoliage.blocks.fallingLeaves.tooltip=A list of Block filters that determine which blocks can render Falling Leaf particles.\nThis is separate from the blocks that can render Extra Leaves.
betterfoliage.blocks.logs=Filters: Logs
betterfoliage.blocks.logs.tooltip=A list of block filters that determine which blocks are recognized as Logs.\nHas an impact on Rounded Logs.
betterfoliage.blocks.sand=Filters: Sand
betterfoliage.blocks.sand.tooltip=A list of block filters that determine which blocks are recognized as Sand.\nHas an impact on Coral.
betterfoliage.blocks.lilypad=Filters: Lilypads
betterfoliage.blocks.lilypad.tooltip=A list of block filters that determine which blocks are recognized as Lilypads.
betterfoliage.blocks.cactus=Filters: Cactus
betterfoliage.blocks.cactus.tooltip=A list of block filters that determine which blocks are recognized as Cactus.
betterfoliage.blocks.soulsand=Filters: Soul Sand
betterfoliage.blocks.soulsand.tooltip=A list of block filters that determine which blocks are recognized as Soul Sand.\nHas an impact on Soul Particles.

# Connected Grass
betterfoliage.connectedGrass=Connected Grass
betterfoliage.connectedGrass.tooltip=Use grass top texture on all sides of the Grass block if a dirt block is beneath it.
betterfoliage.connectedGrass.snowEnabled=Connected Snow
betterfoliage.connectedGrass.snowEnabled.tooltip=If a connected grass block is covered by snow, use the snow's texture for the grass sides instead of the grass texture.

# Short Grass
betterfoliage.shortGrass=Short Grass & Mycelium
betterfoliage.shortGrass.tooltip=Tufts of grass/mycelium on top of appropriate blocks.
betterfoliage.shortGrass.grassEnabled=Enable Grass
betterfoliage.shortGrass.grassEnabled.tooltip=Is this feature enabled for Grass blocks?
betterfoliage.shortGrass.myceliumEnabled=Enable Mycelium
betterfoliage.shortGrass.myceliumEnabled.tooltip=Is this feature enabled for Mycelium blocks?
betterfoliage.shortGrass.snowEnabled=Enable Snow
betterfoliage.shortGrass.snowEnabled.tooltip=Render snow tinted short grass if the block is covered by snow.
betterfoliage.shortGrass.mixTextures=Mix textures
betterfoliage.shortGrass.mixTextures.tooltip=Allow mixing of two different textures for each tuft of grass/mycelium in each block.\nDoes not work if using generated textures.
betterfoliage.shortGrass.useGenerated=Use generated grass texture
betterfoliage.shortGrass.useGenerated.tooltip=Dynamically generate a texture for the short grass by copying the top half of the tallgrass texture from the current resource pack.

# Round Logs
betterfoliage.roundLogs=Round Logs
betterfoliage.roundLogs.tooltip=Should render log blocks with beveled corners, giving them a rounded look?
betterfoliage.roundLogs.radiusSmall=Small chamfer radius
betterfoliage.roundLogs.radiusSmall.tooltip=How much to chop off from the logs corners.\nUse 0.292893218813 for an equally sided octagon.
betterfoliage.roundLogs.radiusLarge=Large chamfer radius
betterfoliage.roundLogs.radiusLarge.tooltip=How much to chop off from the logs corner, when it is connected to other blocks on two of it's sides.
betterfoliage.roundLogs.connectToSolids=Connect to other solids
betterfoliage.roundLogs.connectToSolids.tooltip=Should round logs connect to other non-log solid blocks?
betterfoliage.roundLogs.connectLenient=Lenient connections
betterfoliage.roundLogs.connectLenient.tooltip=Allow logs to connect to each other when forming an L shape, not requiring a full 2x2 grid.
betterfoliage.roundLogs.connectPerpendicular=Connect to perpendicular logs
betterfoliage.roundLogs.connectPerpendicular.tooltip=Link perpendicular logs by rendering an end cap from one round log at the same coordinates as the adjacent log.
betterfoliage.roundLogs.connectGrass=Connect Grass
betterfoliage.roundLogs.connectGrass.tooltip=Render a grass block under round logs instead of dirt if there another grass block adjacent to it.
betterfoliage.roundLogs.zProtection=Z-Protection
betterfoliage.roundLogs.zProtection.tooltip=How much to shrink the radius of perpendicular end caps to prevent z-fighting.\nHigher values prevent the end caps from having visible distortion from up close, but may flicker (z-fight) when viewed from afar.\nThis value should be kept as high as possible without noticing any visual glitches.

# Extra Leaves
betterfoliage.extraLeaves=Extra Leaves
betterfoliage.extraLeaves.tooltip=Extra round leaves on leaf blocks.
betterfoliage.extraLeaves.snowEnabled=Enable snow
betterfoliage.extraLeaves.snowEnabled.tooltip=Render an extra snow overlay on top of a leaf block if it is covered by a layer of snow.
betterfoliage.extraLeaves.surfaceOnly=Surface only
betterfoliage.extraLeaves.surfaceOnly.tooltip=Extra Leaves will only be rendered on blocks with at least one exposed side.\nA side is marked as exposed if it's neighbor is not a full opaque block nor another leaf block.
betterfoliage.extraLeaves.dense=Dense mode
betterfoliage.extraLeaves.dense.tooltip=Render a cross square of extra leaves on all three axes of a leaf block, not just the vertical axis.
betterfoliage.extraLeaves.renderBaseBlock=Render base block
betterfoliage.extraLeaves.renderBaseBlock.tooltip=Should the base leaf block be rendered alongside the extra leaves?\nWorks best with Dense mode enabled, otherwise the leaves will look a little lackluster when not viewed from the side.

# Falling Leaves
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves=Falling Leaves
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.tooltip=Should emit falling leaf particles from the bottom of leaf blocks.
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.speed=Particle Speed
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.speed.tooltip=Speed of the particle when falling.
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.rotationSpeed=Rotation Speed
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.rotationSpeed.tooltip=Leaf particle rotation speed.
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.groundDampening=Ground Dampening
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.groundDampening.tooltip=Dampening value of the "settling" effect to apply to the leaf when hitting the ground.\nThe smaller this value, the quicker the particle stops moving once it hits the ground.
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.windStrength=Wind Strength
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.windStrength.tooltip=Magnitude of wind effects in good weather (spread of normal distribution centered on 0).
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.stormStrength=Storm strength
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.stormStrength.tooltip=Additional magnitude of wind effects in rainy weather (spread of normal distribution centered on 0).\nThis magnitude is additional to the normal wind strength.
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.chance=Particle Chance
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.chance.tooltip=Chance that a random tick on a leaf block will spawn a particle.
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.perturb=Perturbation
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.perturb.tooltip=Magnitude of perturbation effect. Adds a corkscrew-like motion to the particle synchronized to its rotation.
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.fadeoutTime=Particle Fadeout Time
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.fadeoutTime.tooltip=How long the leaf fadeout should last, in seconds. Will be less than it's total lifetime when spawned.
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.fadeoutOnGroundHit=Fadeout on ground hit
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.fadeoutOnGroundHit.tooltip=Should the leaf immediately start to fade out when hitting the ground?
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.opacityHack=Opaque particles
betterfoliage.fallingLeaves.opacityHack.tooltip=Stop transparent blocks obscuring particles even when particle is in front.\n§cWARNING: May cause glitches.

# Rising Souls
betterfoliage.risingSouls=Rising Souls
betterfoliage.risingSouls.tooltip=Should emit rising soul particles from the top of Soul Sand blocks?
betterfoliage.risingSouls.speed=Particle Speed
betterfoliage.risingSouls.speed.tooltip=Ascent speed of a soul particle, in blocks per second.
betterfoliage.risingSouls.chance=Particle Chance
betterfoliage.risingSouls.chance.tooltip=Chance that a random tick on a Soul Sand block will spawn a particle.
betterfoliage.risingSouls.perturb=Perturbation
betterfoliage.risingSouls.perturb.tooltip=Magnitude of perturbation effect. Adds a corkscrew-like motion to the particle.
betterfoliage.risingSouls.headSize=Head Size
betterfoliage.risingSouls.headSize.tooltip=Size of the soul head particle.
betterfoliage.risingSouls.trailSize=Trail Size
betterfoliage.risingSouls.trailSize.tooltip=Initial size of the trail particles that follow the head particle.
betterfoliage.risingSouls.opacity=Opacity
betterfoliage.risingSouls.opacity.tooltip=Opacity of the particle effect. The closer this value is to 0, the fainter the soul particles will appear.
betterfoliage.risingSouls.sizeDecay=Size Decay
betterfoliage.risingSouls.sizeDecay.tooltip=Trail particle size relative to its size in the previous tick.\nThe smaller this number is, the quicker the trail reduces in size.
betterfoliage.risingSouls.opacityDecay=Opacity Decay
betterfoliage.risingSouls.opacityDecay.tooltip=Trail particle opacity relative to its opacity in the previous tick.\nThe smaller this number is, the quicker the particle disappears.
betterfoliage.risingSouls.trailDensity=Trail Density
betterfoliage.risingSouls.trailDensity.tooltip=Every Nth tick, add a particle to the trail.

